—	test_key.py#/Module/5/body/2/args/0/arg	self
—	test_key.py#/Module/5/body/2/body/0/value/value	"""A record of any other sheet but the sheet of runs MUST begin with _input value; then _instance, the zero-based position of its instance among the instances of its input value, the value itself first, counted in the order written; then _parent, the _instance of the record whose instance holds its own, which with _input value is a foreign key, possibly into its own relation; then _pointer, the JSON Pointer to its instance evaluated from that record's instance. A record whose instance is its location's own, a subschema applying to the same location, has the _input value and _instance of its location's record and leaves _parent and _pointer empty. No key holds the access path from the input value to its instance."""
—	test_key.py#/Module/5/body/2/body/1/items/0/context_expr/func/value/id	self
